menu "Muse VM account"

    config GADGET_SDK_TOKEN
        string "Maker SDK token (mgst_...)"
        default ""
        help
            The maker's SDK token from gadgets.muse.ai (Account > SDK
            tokens). It is sent with device-token mint and refresh, and
            Muse records it at pairing time. It is NOT a device credential
            on its own: pairing still needs the user's Muse account.
            Leave empty here and set it per build directory (menuconfig)
            or over the serial console — never commit a real token.

endmenu
